is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
frequency: 155
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and sld_partocracy_stage >= 3 and left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_sld_public_boards_timer = 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_sld_public_boards_timer = -1
card-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp

= The Republic's Boards

Vacancies open across public companies and agencies. SLD can supply people who
have run institutions before. It can also supply a complete chain of political
obligation that follows them into every boardroom.

Doctrine: **[+ sld_partocracy_doctrine_label +]**. Patronage exposure: **[+
sld_patronage_exposure +]/100**. Government delivery: **[+
government_delivery +]/100**.

- @sld_boards_machine
- @sld_boards_shortlist
- @sld_boards_refuse

@sld_boards_machine
title: Give the apparatus control of the appointment round
subtitle: Experienced loyalists deliver quickly. Patronage exposure, coalition dissent and public distrust surge.
on-arrival: barons_strength += 4; barons_dissent -= 8; administrative_capacity += 4; government_delivery += 5; leadership_authority += 4; sld_patronage_exposure += 13; public_trust -= 5; institutional_trust -= 3; ko_relation -= 5; p2050_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 6; progressives_dissent += 5; news_headline = "SLD's apparatus takes control of public-company appointments"

Every nominee has a record and a sponsor. Projects move because nobody has to
ask who may make a decision; nobody can prove where competence ends and debt
to the party begins.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_boards_shortlist
title: Use experienced SLD candidates in an open shortlist
subtitle: Preserve institutional memory under published criteria. The apparatus dislikes competing for its old jobs.
on-arrival: administrative_capacity += 5; government_delivery += 3; public_trust += 3; institutional_trust += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; sld_patronage_exposure -= 3; barons_strength += 1; barons_dissent += 4; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; news_headline = "Experienced SLD managers compete through an open public shortlist"

The names are familiar. The scores, conflicts and interviews are public. Some
old hands win and owe the appointment to a process rather than a chair.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_boards_refuse
title: Exclude party cadres from the appointment round
subtitle: Free. Maximise independence; SLD's apparatus treats exclusion as coalition bad faith.
on-arrival: poland_sld_public_boards_timer = 7; public_trust += 3; institutional_trust += 3; sld_patronage_exposure -= 4; barons_dissent += 10; government_coalition_dissent += 4; administrative_capacity -= 2; leadership_authority -= 2; news_headline = "Government excludes party cadres from public-company appointments"

The firewall is clear enough to explain in one sentence. It also discards
qualified candidates because their biographies make the sentence harder.

- #poland_card_finish


