= The Mayors' Cabinet

SLD mayors bring a list of projects already designed and permits already
issued. They want a standing cabinet channel and a protected share of
investment. Coalition partners call that delivery by postcode and party card.

Local network: **[+ local_network +]/100**. Patronage exposure: **[+
sld_patronage_exposure +]/100**. KO relation: **[+ ko_relation +]/100**.

- @sld_mayors_compact
- @sld_mayors_formula
- @sld_mayors_refuse

@sld_mayors_compact
title: Give SLD mayors a protected delivery compact
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. Projects move fast; partisan allocation and coalition costs remain visible.
choose-if: budget >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: The protected municipal programme needs two budget points.
on-arrival: budget -= 2; local_network += 7; barons_strength += 3; barons_dissent -= 6; government_delivery += 6; administrative_capacity += 3; rural_support += 3; household_security += 3; list_confidence += 4; sld_patronage_exposure += 8; public_trust -= 2; ko_relation -= 5; p2050_relation -= 4; psl_relation -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 5; news_headline = "SLD mayors receive a protected national delivery compact"

Roads, clinics and housing start from complete files rather than ministerial
ideas. The map of first-round winners looks remarkably like the party map.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_mayors_formula
title: Fund ready municipal projects through a public formula
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Use the mayors' preparation without reserving money for their party.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The municipal project round needs one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; local_network += 4; government_delivery += 4; administrative_capacity += 3; rural_support += 2; household_security += 2; public_trust += 3; institutional_trust += 2; sld_patronage_exposure -= 2; barons_dissent += 3; ko_relation += 1; p2050_relation += 1; psl_relation += 1; news_headline = "Ready municipal projects receive funding through a public formula"

SLD municipalities still win often because they arrived prepared. Other
mayors can read the formula and do the same next time.

- #poland_card_finish

@sld_mayors_refuse
title: Keep municipal lobbying outside cabinet
subtitle: Free. Protect ministerial control; SLD mayors and regional chairs escalate dissent.
on-arrival: poland_sld_mayors_timer = 7; barons_dissent += 9; local_network -= 2; list_confidence -= 2; government_delivery -= 2; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; government_coalition_dissent -= 1; news_headline = "Cabinet refuses SLD mayors a standing delivery channel"

Projects return to ordinary ministry queues. The mayors return to their
regions with a list of ministers who told them to wait.

- #poland_card_finish


