= Equal Citizenship in One Act

Wiosna wants one bill covering marriage, reproductive autonomy, gender
recognition and equal treatment. Coalition managers want separate votes so
each partner can support equality in a different number of places.

Liberal bridge: **[+ spring_liberal_bridge +]/100**. Marriage progress: **[+
marriage_reform_progress +]/100**. PSL relation: **[+ psl_relation +]/100**.

- @wiosna_citizenship_omnibus
- @wiosna_citizenship_sequence
- @wiosna_citizenship_refuse

@wiosna_citizenship_omnibus
title: Introduce the complete equal-citizenship act
subtitle: Wiosna owns a historic confrontation. PSL relations, coalition stability and backlash take the full cost.
on-arrival: spring_strength += 4; progressives_strength += 3; spring_dissent -= 9; progressives_dissent -= 7; feminist_trust += 7; progressive_credibility += 6; marriage_reform_progress += 10; abortion_reform_progress += 9; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 8; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_left_ownership += 8; public_mood_pending_abortion_rights_left_ownership += 7; spring_liberal_bridge += 5; young_support += 5; urban_progressive_support += 4; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation -= 3; psl_relation -= 10; government_coalition_dissent += 9; early_election_risk += 4; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "Government introduces one complete equal-citizenship act"

Nobody can trade one group away without voting against the whole principle.
That is the bill's moral clarity and its parliamentary danger.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_citizenship_sequence
title: Sequence the family and reproductive bills
subtitle: Move both files, but let coalition partners vote on separate timetables.
on-arrival: spring_strength += 2; progressives_strength += 1; spring_dissent -= 4; progressives_dissent -= 3; feminist_trust += 4; progressive_credibility += 3; marriage_reform_progress += 6; abortion_reform_progress += 5; public_mood_pending_lgbt_equality_salience += 4; spring_liberal_bridge += 3; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; psl_relation -= 4; government_coalition_dissent += 3; coalition_blur += 2; news_headline = "Government sequences separate family and reproductive equality bills"

Both promises enter Parliament. Each can be delayed, amended or defeated
without forcing a vote on the other.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_citizenship_refuse
title: Refuse another cabinet confrontation over rights
subtitle: Free. Preserve coalition room; Spring, progressives and movements escalate dissent.
on-arrival: poland_wiosna_equal_citizenship_timer = 7; spring_dissent += 10; progressives_dissent += 8; feminist_trust -= 5; progressive_credibility -= 4; movement_autonomy += 4; coalition_blur += 4; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; psl_relation += 3; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Cabinet refuses a new confrontation over equal citizenship"

The existing timetable remains. Wiosna's current calls that a timetable for
waiting, not governing.

- #poland_card_finish


