= A Secular Republic

The social-liberal route has spoken clearly about the Church. It must now
choose between a comprehensive settlement, a negotiated transparency package
and another year in which clarity remains a speech.

Secular support: **[+ secular_state_support +]/100**. Reform progress: **[+
church_reform_progress +]/100**. PSL relation: **[+ psl_relation +]/100**.

- @wiosna_secular_full
- @wiosna_secular_accounts
- @wiosna_secular_refuse

@wiosna_secular_full
title: End public privilege and renegotiate the Church settlement
subtitle: Secular ownership and young support surge; conservative partners and institutional peace pay.
on-arrival: spring_strength += 4; progressives_strength += 2; spring_dissent -= 8; progressives_dissent -= 6; church_reform_progress += 10; public_mood_pending_secular_state_support += 9; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 8; anticlerical_edge += 7; young_support += 4; urban_progressive_support += 4; feminist_trust += 3; spring_liberal_bridge += 3; ko_relation -= 2; p2050_relation -= 5; psl_relation -= 11; government_coalition_dissent += 9; early_election_risk += 4; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "Government opens a comprehensive secular-republic settlement"

Financing, schools, chaplaincies and legal privileges move into one public
negotiation. Every ambiguity that once kept a partner calm becomes a vote.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_secular_accounts
title: Require transparent accounts and equal public-service rules
subtitle: A narrower settlement wins more allies and leaves the constitutional bargain untouched.
on-arrival: spring_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent -= 2; church_reform_progress += 5; public_mood_pending_secular_state_support += 8; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership += 4; institutional_trust += 3; public_trust += 3; ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 1; psl_relation -= 3; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Church funding receives transparent accounts and equal service rules"

The state learns what it pays and applies ordinary standards to services it
funds. Concordat questions remain outside the bill.

- #poland_card_finish

@wiosna_secular_refuse
title: Refuse to spend coalition capital on the secular-state file
subtitle: Free. Keep partners calm; Spring, progressives and young voters register the retreat.
on-arrival: poland_wiosna_secular_state_timer = 7; spring_dissent += 9; progressives_dissent += 7; young_support -= 3; public_mood_pending_secular_state_left_ownership -= 3; progressive_credibility -= 3; ko_relation += 1; p2050_relation += 2; psl_relation += 4; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Cabinet postpones the secular-state settlement"

No privilege expands. None is removed. The route keeps its doctrine and loses
another chance to prove it governs.

