= The Social-Market Budget

Market Left ministers offer a package the liberal centre recognises: fewer
rates, a harder spending ceiling and targeted transfers replacing some
universal promises. The labour flank recognises it too.

Market Left support: **[+ market_liberal_support +]/100**. Economic line: **[+
left_economic_position +]/100**. Union trust: **[+ union_trust +]/100**.

- @market_budget_full
- @market_budget_floor
- @market_budget_refuse

@market_budget_full
title: Adopt the targeted social-market budget
subtitle: Revenue capacity, growth and centre relations improve; universality and the labour flank retreat.
on-arrival: market_liberal_support += 11; market_liberal_strength += 4; market_liberal_dissent -= 9; budget += 3; budget_balance += 3; fiscal_stress -= 4; economic_growth += 0.6; inflation -= 0.4; left_economic_position += 7; left_right_score += 5; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 5; ko_relation += 7; p2050_relation += 6; psl_relation += 3; public_trust += 2; welfare_expectation -= 5; universal_solidarity -= 5; public_mood_pending_social_spending_support -= 3; labor_dissent += 11; razem_dissent += 12; union_trust -= 7; opzz_cooperation -= 5; workers_support -= 3; public_sector_support -= 3; government_coalition_dissent -= 4; news_headline = "Government adopts Market Left's targeted social-market budget"

The budget is funded and legible. It also asks households to prove need where
the previous programme treated membership in society as proof enough.

- #poland_card_finish

@market_budget_floor
title: Simplify taxes but protect universal service floors
subtitle: A smaller market turn keeps hospitals, schools and pensions outside means testing.
on-arrival: market_liberal_support += 6; market_liberal_strength += 2; market_liberal_dissent -= 5; budget += 1; budget_balance += 1; fiscal_stress -= 2; economic_growth += 0.3; left_economic_position += 3; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 3; ko_relation += 4; p2050_relation += 3; universal_solidarity += 1; public_sector_support += 1; labor_dissent += 4; razem_dissent += 5; union_trust -= 2; government_coalition_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Government simplifies taxes while protecting universal service floors"

Transfers become more targeted and the tax schedule shorter. Core services
remain rights rather than assessments.

- #poland_card_finish

@market_budget_refuse
