= The Sovereign Welfare State

SPS proposes a citizenship preference in housing, family benefits and public
procurement. It combines an expansive welfare promise with a border around who
may claim it. The progressive current demands the promise without the border.

Social-patriot dissent: **[+ social_patriot_dissent +]/100**. Universal
solidarity: **[+ universal_solidarity +]/100**. International isolation: **[+
sld_populist_international_isolation +]/100**.

