on-arrival: social_patriot_support += 11; social_patriot_strength += 4; social_patriot_dissent -= 10; sld_populist_media_salience += 9; sld_populist_factional_capture += 6; household_security += 8; rural_support += 7; workers_support += 4; local_network += 3; economic_growth += 0.5; inflation += 0.5; budget -= 4; fiscal_stress += 6; institutional_trust -= 4; ko_relation -= 7; p2050_relation -= 6; government_coalition_dissent += 7; news_headline = "Government launches Miller's commanded people's bank"

Credit reaches places commercial scoring abandoned. Political instructions
