@populist_bank_guarantee
title: Offer public guarantees through existing banks
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity. Expand credit with published eligibility and shared risk.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The guarantee fund needs one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; social_patriot_support += 6; social_patriot_strength += 2; social_patriot_dissent -= 4; household_security += 5; rural_support += 4; workers_support += 2; economic_growth += 0.3; institutional_trust += 3; public_trust += 3; ko_relation -= 2; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Public guarantees expand household, farm and municipal credit"

The state sets the terms and shares the losses. It does not decide every loan.

- #poland_card_finish

@populist_bank_refuse
title: Regulate lenders without a public credit arm
subtitle: Free. Avoid concentrated fiscal risk; SPS says debtors have been left with the same banks.
