= Foreign Capital Must Pay

Miller proposes turnover levies aimed at sectors dominated by foreign firms.
The revenue is already assigned to medicines and pensions in the launch speech.

International isolation: **[+ sld_populist_international_isolation +]/100**.
Budget: **[+ budget +]**.

- @populist_capital_levy
- @populist_capital_profit
- @populist_capital_refuse

@populist_capital_levy
title: Impose the foreign-capital levies
subtitle: Revenue and nationalist welfare politics surge; investment and international relations deteriorate.
