@populist_referendum_citizens
title: Create deliberative citizen votes with turnout rules
subtitle: Open major decisions while protecting minorities and ordinary administration.
on-arrival: social_patriot_support += 5; social_patriot_strength += 2; social_patriot_dissent -= 3; anti_system_trust += 4; public_trust += 5; institutional_trust += 4; constitutional_restraint += 3; universal_solidarity += 2; government_delivery -= 1; ko_relation -= 2; p2050_relation -= 1; government_coalition_dissent += 2; news_headline = "Government proposes deliberative citizen votes with turnout safeguards"

Citizens may compel a vote after hearings and a verified petition. Miller calls
the safeguards a seminar; the public calls them a route in.

